=: title reaping inactive accounts
=: date 2026-05-03
=: tags ann

Greetings!

As part of our routine maintenance and general house-keeping, we decided to add another task to the list.  We are going to start deleting unused accounts, effective immediately.  We will be removing all accounts that meet the following criteria:

  No prose posts
  No pgs projects
  No pico+ subs
  No access in the last year

We will also be doing this on a semi-regular basis.  This is all in an effort to keep our database lean and catered to active users.  As of right now this means thousands of accounts are going to be removed and their username free for others to claim.

As we evaluate usage we might change this criteria in the future but we will be sure to make an announcement if it does change.

Cya!
